<div class="watchdeck-home">
  <div class="container py-4 py-lg-5">
    <section class="home-intro text-center mx-auto">
      <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mt-3">Filme und Serien <span>finden</span></h1>
      <p class="home-lead mt-3">Ein Schulprojekt rund um Filme, Serien und Streaming-Anbieter.</p>

      <form class="home-search mx-auto mt-4" action="/movies" method="get" role="search">
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="homeSearch">Filme oder Serien suchen</label>
        <input id="homeSearch" class="form-control" type="search" name="q" placeholder="Film oder Serie suchen...">
        <button class="btn home-search-button" type="submit" aria-label="Suchen">⌕</button>
      </form>

      <div class="provider-filters d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-2 mt-4">
        <a class="provider-filter" href="/movies"><span class="provider-dot netflix-dot">N</span> Netflix</a>
        <a class="provider-filter" href="/movies"><span class="provider-dot disney-dot">D+</span> Disney+</a>
        <a class="provider-filter" href="/movies"><span class="provider-dot prime-dot">p</span> Prime Video</a>
        <a class="provider-filter" href="/movies"><span class="provider-dot apple-dot">tv+</span> Apple TV+</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-banner mt-5">
      <div class="feature-copy">
        <h2 class="mt-0">Was läuft wo?</h2>
        <p>Wir möchten hier zeigen, bei welchen Streaming-Anbietern es verschiedene Filme und Serien gibt.</p>
        <a class="btn feature-button" href="/movies">Zu den Filmen <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="examples-section mt-5">
      <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-md-end gap-3 mb-3">
